  _id: 14041215
  _key: DIALOGUE_SERAPHINE_NODE_Q2_REWARDED
  _displayName: 
  _description: 
  _speakerName: Seraphine
  _dialogueText: 'Then it is yours.

    The path ahead will not be easy. The corruption
    that consumed Aurelian is only a fragment of a greater darkness.

    But where
    I once saw only loss, I now see the possibility of something new.

    Go, traveller.
    Carry the light into the places where it has long been forgotten.

    And should
    our paths cross again, I hope it will be beneath a brighter sky.'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: Farewell, Seraphine.
